        "geography": "Iran in the international Global Innovation Index comparison",
        "population_scope": "Economies included in each annual GII edition; coverage varies by edition",
        "frequency": "annual",
        "calendar": "gregorian",
        "methodology": "Ordinal overall position in each GII edition, reproduced from the historical table in WIPO’s 2025 Iran profile. A lower number denotes a higher relative position. Years identify index editions, not a common reference year for every underlying indicator. Framework, data availability, and comparison coverage can change. This is an annual ranking record, not a strictly comparable indicator of innovation volume, commercial returns, or market size.",
